notes.notes:
[list]
[*]The score bonus multipliers for "no damage taken" and "all enemies destroyed" have been swapped and are now 15% and 10% respectively, because completing a level without damage is objectively harder than destroying all enemies;
[*]Fixed an issue with the early skipping of the final credits;
[*]Fixed a rare critical game crash.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Accelerated loading of the game and levels;
[*] Rebalance of Moneybag's weapons:
[olist]
[*] Damage of Large Blasters increased from 50-65 to 80-95;
[*] Damage of Small Blasters increased from 40-50 to 60-70;
[*] Damage of Spammers increased from 30-45 to 60-75;
[*] Damage of Centrifuges increased from 45-60 to 90-110;[/olist]
[*] Minor cosmetic fixes and improvements;
[*] A couple of rare crashes have been fixed.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Added the ability to change the current weapon at any moment;
[*] Added the ability to control the player ship using the mouse;
[*] Labels have been added to loading screens, and a separate Game Over screen has been added;
[*] The appearance of Moneybag's triple cannon projectiles has been changed, and their damage has been increased from 30-45 to 45-60;
[*] Fixed a bug when enemy missiles didn't explode when colliding with each other;
[*] Scavenger Driller health reduced from 3000 to 2850;
[*] The health of the "Threesome" Scavengers has been reduced from 1200 to 1100;
[*] The aiming speed of level 4 Blaster projectiles has been reduced;
[*] The damage of level 4 Blaster projectiles has been reduced from 50-56 to 43-49;
[*] The damage of level 5 Blaster projectiles has been reduced from 62-70 to 56-64;
[*] Added an additional "burning" effect for level 4 and 5 Lasers;
[*] The attack distance of the level 3 Wavegun has been slightly increased;
[*] The attack distance of the level 4 Wavegun has been increased;
[*] The attack distance of the level 5 Wavegun has been significantly increased;
[*] The damage of the level 4 Wavegun has been increased from 40-60 to 50-60;
[*] The damage of the level 5 Wavegun has been increased from 40-60 to 50-60;
[*] Increased the explosion radius of the level 1 Sungun;
[*] Slightly increased the explosion radius of the level 2 Sungun.
[/list]

[list]
[*] One more rare crash fix;
[*] One more attempt to fix a bug with the non-detection of XInput gamepads;
[*] Couple of minor fixes.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Added possibility to skip bosses intro dialogues;
[*] Added possibility to skip final credits from a game controller;
[*] [url=https://space-pressure-3d.fandom.com/wiki/Scavenger_Driller]Scavenger Driller[/url] projectile damage decreased from 75-200 to 75-100;
[*] Couple of minor fixes.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Fixed a couple of rare game crashes;
[*] Fixed a bug with starting the game without sound;
[*] Most likely fixed a bug with gamepads not being detected for some players (but it is not exactly);
[*] Several minor fixes.
[/list]
